id           = CWE-1115
name         = Source Code Element without Standard Prologue
abstraction  = Base
structure    = Simple
status       = Incomplete

description : The source code contains elements such as source files that do not consistently provide a prologue or header that has been standardized for the project.

extended description : Standard prologues or headers may contain information such as module name, version number, author, date, purpose, function, assumptions, limitations, accuracy considerations, etc.

notes : https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1115.html
